    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-startle-reflex=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"You aren't fast because you're fast. You're fast because the world keeps deciding to miss.\"</em></p><p><strong>Startle Reflex (1/Soma Break).</strong> Reaction when you are targeted by an attack roll or fail an Intrigue check — move up to 2 squares without provoking opportunity attacks.</p><p><strong>Horns of Bad Luck.</strong> Your natural horns ship as a Jackalope-only Manifestation when you take the heritage — see your Manifestations tab. When violence escalates around you, the GM may describe unsettling omens tied to your presence — a mirror crack, a dropped knife, a candle going out the wrong direction.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"crypJackStartleReflex\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Startle Reflex</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Reaction  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">When targeted by an attack roll or you fail an Intrigue check, move up to 2 squares without provoking opportunity attacks.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
